      "translation": {
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [],
        "english_text": "(Kokila sees Uma sitting beside the pool. Uma is gazing at Vingan’s image in the water, in imagination.... As she is absorbed in that thought, Kokila comes near and calls “Uma”; Uma at once breaks from her reverie and composes herself.)"
      }
    },
