        "source_locator": {
          "kind": "source-unlabelled-speech",
          "ordinal": 4,
          "description": "Source block 4: அவர் நம்ப ஜமீன் அந்தஸ்துக்கு சமமான அந்தஸ்து உள்ளவரா இருப்பாரா?...இல்லே...சாதாரணமான குடும்பத்தைச் சேர்ந்தவரா இருப்பாரா?... விங்கனை நான் விரும"
        },
        "speaker_label": null,
        "speaker_label_origin": "source-unlabelled",
        "source_delimiter": null,
        "page_provenance": [
          {
            "pdf_page": 35,
            "printed_page": 34
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The source prints no speaker label for this spoken unit; no speaker or immutable dialogue ID is inferred."
        ],
        "english_text": "Would he be a man of status equal to our estate?... Or would he belong to an ordinary family?... I love Vingan!... But if I learn that he belongs to an ordinary family... the very next moment... I will tear him out of my heart and throw him away!..."
      }
    },
