      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Why make it so difficult? Let us toss heads or tails and see what sort of man he is!... (taking a one-rupee coin from inside her jacket) If heads falls, he is from a great family... if the flower side falls... an ordinary family... all right?...",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
