        "source_locator": {
          "kind": "song-body",
          "ordinal": 12,
          "description": "Source block 12: மேடையில் ஆடிடும் மெல்லிய பூங்காற்றே! — நீ ஆடையில் ஆடினால் மன்மதன் விளையாட்டே! மேனகை போலொரு பூங்கையை புதுப்பாட்டே! — உன் மேனியின் சாயலோ ஆனந்த"
        },
        "speaker_label": null,
        "speaker_label_origin": null,
        "source_delimiter": null,
        "page_provenance": [
          {
            "pdf_page": 36,
            "printed_page": 35
          },
          {
            "pdf_page": 37,
            "printed_page": 36
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "mode": "semantic-poetic-source-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "Item-level lyric authorship remains unresolved; the film-level `பாடல்கள்: கவிஞர் வாலி` credit is not promoted to this occurrence."
        ],
        "english_lines": [
          "Dancing upon the stage,",
          "O gentle flower-breeze! — if you",
          "dance upon her dress,",
          "it is Manmatha’s play!",
          "A woman like Menaka,",
          "a new song in the flower-garden! — Is your",
          "body’s radiance",
          "a fountain of delight!"
        ]
      }
    },
