          "description": "Source block 13: பழுக்கப் பழுக்க-ரசம் பிழியப் பிழியப்-பழம் உள்ளூரக் கள்ளூறத் தள்ளாடுமோ?"
        },
        "speaker_label": null,
        "speaker_label_origin": null,
        "source_delimiter": null,
        "page_provenance": [
          {
            "pdf_page": 36,
            "printed_page": 35
          },
          {
            "pdf_page": 37,
            "printed_page": 36
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "mode": "semantic-poetic-source-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "Item-level lyric authorship remains unresolved; the film-level `பாடல்கள்: கவிஞர் வாலி` credit is not promoted to this occurrence."
        ],
        "english_lines": [
          "Ripening and ripening — the juice,",
          "pressed and pressed — the fruit,",
          "with liquor welling within,",
          "will it stagger?"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
